  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation between Georgian Revenue Service and Swedish Tax Agency</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Cooperation between Georgian Revenue Service and Swedish Tax Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skatteverket st&#xf6;djer den the Georgian Revenue Service (GRS) f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka GRS institutionella kapacitet och &#xf6;ka skattebetalarnas efterlevnad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Tax Agency supports the Georgian Revenue Service (GRS) in enhancing the institutional capacity of the GRS and increase compliance by taxpayers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is defined as follows - Enhanced institutional capacity of the GRS and increased compliance by taxpayers.

The overall objective is planned to be achieved through aiming at the six key project outcome level objectives;  

- Improved service delivery based on evidence and improved knowledge about taxpayers and their needs as well as internal areas of improvement;

- Improved taxpayer trust;

- Strengthened institutional ability to manage enterprise and operational risks;

- Enhanced compliance risk management ability of the GRS;

- Enhanced data management and data security;

- Informed processes and decisions based on big data/data analytics;

For achieving those outcome objectives the contribution consists of the following components:

(1) Taxpayer Service; (2) Enterprise Risk Management; (3) Compliance Risk Management; and (4) Data management;</narrative>
  </description>
